      "mergedPostDetails": "[Index Controllers]\n\nSince the new update GestureWeight always gets set to 0 for a split-second when switching between gestures, and additionally, when switching between some gestures the Gesture integer switches to 0 for a split-second before outputting the correct value - for example: \n\nFist, trigger pulled (Int 1 Weight 1) switch to Thumbs Up, trigger pulled (Int 7 Weight 1) goes to Int 0, Weight 0 at first instead of switching directly, which messes A LOT with gesture controls, depending on your setup.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1490] Gesture + GestureWeight values don't transition directly anymore",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
